### Google Health API Integration Test
### Base URL: http://localhost:7125

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:7125
@accessToken = Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...
@googleToken = ya29.a0AfH6SMC...

###
# 1. Register a new user (if needed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "testuser@example.com",
    "password": "TestPass123!",
    "firstName": "Test",
    "lastName": "User"
}

###
# 2. Login to get JWT token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "testuser@example.com",
    "password": "TestPass123!"
}

###
# 3. Validate Google Health token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/googlehealth/validate-token
Authorization: {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

"{{googleToken}}"

###
# 4. Sync all Google Health data
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/googlehealth/sync
Authorization: {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "accessToken": "{{googleToken}}",
    "startDate": "2025-09-28T00:00:00Z",
    "endDate": "2025-10-05T23:59:59Z",
    "dataTypes": [
        "heart_rate",
        "blood_pressure", 
        "oxygen_saturation",
        "body_temperature",
        "sleep",
        "activity",
        "stress_level"
    ]
}

###
# 5. Get Heart Rate data
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/googlehealth/heart-rate?accessToken={{googleToken}}&startDate=2025-09-28T00:00:00Z&endDate=2025-10-05T23:59:59Z
Authorization: {{accessToken}}

###
# 6. Get Blood Pressure data
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/googlehealth/blood-pressure?accessToken={{googleToken}}&startDate=2025-09-28T00:00:00Z&endDate=2025-10-05T23:59:59Z
Authorization: {{accessToken}}

###
# 7. Get Oxygen Saturation data
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/googlehealth/oxygen-saturation?accessToken={{googleToken}}&startDate=2025-09-28T00:00:00Z&endDate=2025-10-05T23:59:59Z
Authorization: {{accessToken}}

###
# 8. Get Body Temperature data
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/googlehealth/body-temperature?accessToken={{googleToken}}&startDate=2025-09-28T00:00:00Z&endDate=2025-10-05T23:59:59Z
Authorization: {{accessToken}}

###
# 9. Get Sleep data
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/googlehealth/sleep?accessToken={{googleToken}}&startDate=2025-09-28T00:00:00Z&endDate=2025-10-05T23:59:59Z
Authorization: {{accessToken}}

###
# 10. Get Activity data
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/googlehealth/activity?accessToken={{googleToken}}&startDate=2025-09-28T00:00:00Z&endDate=2025-10-05T23:59:59Z
Authorization: {{accessToken}}

###
# 11. Get Stress Level data
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/googlehealth/stress-level?accessToken={{googleToken}}&startDate=2025-09-28T00:00:00Z&endDate=2025-10-05T23:59:59Z
Authorization: {{accessToken}}

###
# Test with minimal data sync (last 24 hours)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/googlehealth/sync
Authorization: {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "accessToken": "{{googleToken}}",
    "dataTypes": ["heart_rate", "sleep", "activity"]
}

###
# Test individual endpoint without date range (defaults to last 7 days)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/googlehealth/heart-rate?accessToken={{googleToken}}
Authorization: {{accessToken}}

###